# === Local backup / scratch copies (machine-specific) ===
# Scratch naming in this project: `_name`, `mname`, `name2.ext`.
# Patterns are deliberately narrow so real files (macos_lipo.py, WSL2.ps1,
# Cargo.lock) are never caught; tracked files stay tracked either way.
_*.*
_*.json
*2.py
*2.html
*2.cjs
*.pyd
Mapp.py
builder/fasterwindowsbuilds.py
builder/morchestrator.py
buildertemp/
farm/mqueue.py
farm/mworker.py
farm/queue2.py
farm/public/mstats.html
farm/1README.md
farm/_README.md
mREADME.md
1README.md
patches/m*.diff
tests/m*.py
.qwen/
backups/
/stop-farm.sh

